node_modules/
# Anchored. Unanchored `lib/` matches a `lib` directory at ANY depth, which
# silently excluded `functions/src/lib/` — i.e. user-doc.ts (every credit
# transaction) and firestore.ts (the named-DB wiring) were never committed, and
# a fresh clone couldn't build functions. This only ever meant the compiled
# output, which the root .gitignore also covers.
/lib/
*.local
.env
firebase-debug.log
firebase-debug.*.log
